

The files in this directory are for Steve Eikenberry's use in Astro 234.
They are fits files of images obtained in Apr'99 using the red camera
of the DBS on the Hale 5m telescope. All frames have been bias-subtracted.

Frame #   (fits files are named bsNNN.fits where NNN is the frame number)

324-333   dome flats
334-343   bias frames (zero integration)

418-422   HD182572 (radial velocity standard, used for S-distortion)
423       NeAr lamp spectrum associated with HD star

397       600 sec exposure of the galaxy UGC 9039
395       NeAr lamp spectrum associated with UGC 9039

Red camera   1200 l/mm   2"slit   tilt angle=43d10'

